          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="181446">DanOCan</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP655 - Red Deer River&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Driving to Saskatoon from Cochrane and I decided to make this an old-school caching trip, which meant focusing on some brass caps I hadn't logged before.  This was my first stop of the day.  Tucker the Dog and I popped out and wandered over to the marker post and made the relatively easy find after cleaning out some debris and leaves from the hole. [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
