          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP655 Red Deer River

[FOUND] while out with 4/4 of HH on a geobike in Drumheller.   At the base of the survey marker but about 30cm below ground level. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
