          <groundspeak:finder id="3061435">Iron Phoenix</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP655 - Red Deer River&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, this time we went east!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; A quick find with a nice view by the river! Too bad for all the mosquitoes already! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_dead.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; Cap is pretty beaten up.  TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
